{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0331_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0331_story_05_title", "source_sha256": "3eb572aaca6c13b7ce529e2a88816b601b4e53300a79f43d9e71283a4a73c6de", "ja": "100万回だって、未来を！", "zh": "即便100万次，也要迎向未来！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0331_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0331_story_05_synopsis", "source_sha256": "70198c07fcd8328d352e72a017b2a43b50c9aca6eeb15a3f242d8bee120f185d", "ja": "第1回定期公演の開幕の挨拶を任された\n未来には、語りたいことが山ほど。\nだが、一番伝えたいことは決まっていた。\n迎えた初日、Team8thは観客へと繋ぐ。\nバトン、『REFRAIN REL@TION』を。", "zh": "被委托负责第1场定期公演的开幕致辞，未来有好多好多想说的话。可是，最想传达的事情已经决定了。首日到来之际，Team8th将接过传给观众的接力棒——《REFRAIN REL@TION》。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0331_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0331_story_05_1000_null", "source_sha256": "b936c1a589dc9b5fa1ae8dcea3203d29e32ff3c1ded726377cb79ffe04aed1c0", "ja": "第1回定期公演初日　数日前……", "zh": "距离第1次定期公演首日，还有几天……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0331_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0331_story_05_1001_014mir", "source_sha256": "95e919ddd280019643154316e8f1704030bc3cfc577b7571f72bc2a5fa701f92", "ja": "えっ、開幕の挨拶ですか？", "zh": "诶，要由我来致开幕词吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0331_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0331_story_05_1002_401pro", "source_sha256": "982acbf07be6533940c19c3f37d155683b8d7fc6edd7555c4a38aa4cd5f13e74", "ja": "うん、初めての定期公演の開幕だし。\nみんなを代表して、未来の言葉で伝えてほしいんだ。", "zh": "嗯，毕竟是第一次定期公演的开幕。\n我想让你代表大家，用未来的话语传达给大家。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0331_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0331_story_05_1003_401pro", "source_sha256": "8fe1a836a073b39fcb2a887a2d27711004455f159b84d8ce1023c5aa374a20a5", "ja": "できれば、ここまで来た道のりとか、\nこれからの意気込みを踏まえて。どうかな？", "zh": "如果可以的话，希望你能结合一路走到这里的历程，以及今后的决心。怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0331_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0331_story_05_1004_014mir", "source_sha256": "ee6d374c54a765ced460924898ffb0facf63040b5da280480d5ad7626f12a564", "ja": "わかりました、任せてください！\n春日未来、がんばります！", "zh": "明白了，包在我身上吧！\n春日未来，我会加油的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0331_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0331_story_05_1005_401pro", "source_sha256": "0e8d60ce3e25cffb0735c767168fd7b03c537c03a7632db870918d5d9fdff1eb", "ja": "おお、頼もしい……！\nもしかして、もう話したいことが浮かんだとか？", "zh": "哦，真可靠……！\n难道你已经想到想聊的话题了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0331_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0331_story_05_1006_014mir", "source_sha256": "e774474e58ba03e9020ae821d4be43503e5eafa842368629403b135a27d1e043", "ja": "はい、ここまでの道のりなら、すぐ思い出せますから。\nまずは美奈子ちゃん達Team1stですよね！", "zh": "是的，只要是到目前为止走过的路，我马上就能想起来。\n首先是美奈子她们的Team1st，对吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0331_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0331_story_05_1007_014mir", "source_sha256": "02a7d3dbd13263ab5cdbd4a93ed4e5269c12d3bebf4a5066e43fc0c8e54ee451", "ja": "すっごくかっこいい曲で、衣装もかっこいいのに\nかわいくて……。あ、お披露目ライブ最高でしたよね♪", "zh": "明明是超帅气的歌曲，服装也很帅气，却又很可爱……啊，首次亮相的演唱会真是太棒了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0331_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0331_story_05_1008_014mir", "source_sha256": "7c499975b91cb0b1f4b7656aafaf3cebbec8009086439e4459d843921a975252", "ja": "それからTeam2ndとTeam3rd！　南の島での\nデビューバトル！　私も行ってみたかったな～♪", "zh": "还有Team2nd和Team3rd！在南方小岛上的出道对决！我也好想去看看啊～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0331_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0331_story_05_1009_401pro", "source_sha256": "d6a88c1b048d33c7f1f7c020dc945a712fd971d6728861ec433eb1fb368be4d9", "ja": "もしかして、1stから順に感想を……？\nそれは……ちょっと長すぎるかな……。", "zh": "该不会，你要从1st开始按顺序说感想吧……？\n那样的话……是不是稍微有点太长了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0331_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0331_story_05_1010_401pro", "source_sha256": "f1e6ea90cc5043578b9d69fdb82614a6f3edce2c9a5f17dc217f32f864d7c0f2", "ja": "道のりを最初からたどるんじゃなくて、こう……\nここまで来た今だからこそ思うこと、で頼めるか？", "zh": "不是从头开始追溯一路走来的历程，而是……能不能请你说说，正因为走到今天这个地步，才会产生的感想？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0331_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0331_story_05_1011_014mir", "source_sha256": "85b7a210c960b8637bfdbf73034ffba4d201ee1e1d3db93eafae4129f52a98d4", "ja": "ここまで来た今だからこそ、ですか……。えっと、\nみんなでバトンを繋いで、リレーみたいで楽しくて……", "zh": "正因为走到这一步，才会有这样的想法吗……嗯，大家一起传递接力棒，就像接力赛一样，感觉很开心……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0331_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0331_story_05_1012_014mir", "source_sha256": "4205688f6e078fb83356bc0f56dd92560651a585573e02aa70847e72fb4df09b", "ja": "いよいよバトンを受け取って、\nこけら落とし公演でデビューして、みんなで歌って……", "zh": "终于接过了接力棒，\n在揭幕公演上出道，大家一起唱歌……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0331_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0331_story_05_1013_014mir", "source_sha256": "97b62ea3800841f81fd0a7e7c7c5cb6ac86646aa861fc71e9e0409a7a2d4fc28", "ja": "あ、そうだ！\n私もみんなにバトンを渡したいって思いました！", "zh": "啊，对了！\n我也想把接力棒交给大家！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0331_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0331_story_05_1014_401pro", "source_sha256": "eee5d3d830e4e88388362040f533ea3f51e94e23f9bc185a114ea25ff588aa4f", "ja": "あ。バトンを、未来も……。", "zh": "啊，对了！我也想把接力棒交给大家！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0331_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0331_story_05_1015_014mir", "source_sha256": "712e38d796739bffb47ab2bc446fa16571063c866dc258a0730117e3e2843a6a", "ja": "私達Team8thはアンカーで、待っているのは\nゴールだから、誰にもバトンを渡せなくて……。", "zh": "我们Team第8组是最后一棒，等待我们的就是终点，所以没法把接力棒交给任何人……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0331_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0331_story_05_1016_014mir", "source_sha256": "098fe49db8722514181b5081e787524c8fec03fb5de80b765c327f153419fc2c", "ja": "でも、バトンはみんなが……みんなが繋いでくれた\nものだから……渡したいです。ううん、渡さなきゃ！", "zh": "可是，这根接力棒是大家……是大家一起传下来的……所以我想把它传出去。不，我一定要把它传出去！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0331_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0331_story_05_1017_401pro", "source_sha256": "664fb72833555b4f5ec3666175951ffeb2211ed775df1133d44ce134868f0632", "ja": "……そうだよな。うん、その方向でいいと思う！\nやっぱり、未来に頼んでよかったよ。", "zh": "……你说得对。嗯，我觉得那样就很好！\n果然拜托未来是对的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0331_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0331_story_05_1018_014mir", "source_sha256": "a40a9e39fb3f600fa67e244145fb592d43864473f5043e44cf2b08dc5c8ff4ef", "ja": "え、ホントですか？\nいやあ、それほどでも～。でへへ♪", "zh": "诶，真的吗？\n哎呀，也没那么夸张啦～嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0331_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0331_story_05_1019_401pro", "source_sha256": "6ccde3a085ad0c39193fc7ca43d3d88c06450ddc6ba4e4af86f0f91f9bb87340", "ja": "それほどでもあるよ！\n……本当にそう思ってるんだ。", "zh": "明明就是很厉害啊！\n……你是真的这么想的啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0331_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0331_story_05_1020_401pro", "source_sha256": "b90ba7bcec8616b56c9dbe6f97a47b941420c30a49c593345e7ec8a8d2c80e5d", "ja": "MILLIONSTARS、百万の星の輝き。\n劇場が、今この未来にたどり着けたのは……。", "zh": "MILLIONSTARS，百万颗群星的光芒。\n剧场如今能迎来这个未来……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0331_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0331_story_05_1021_401pro", "source_sha256": "6f1b4441cf2c158fde15349013b750c76f55daeae776713c43b30060a0d2c1d4", "ja": "春日未来さん。君がいたからです。\n……ありがとう！", "zh": "春日未来。因为有你在。\n……谢谢你！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0331_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0331_story_05_1022_014mir", "source_sha256": "3f63baee82694ec3788f322a21672bf6c8f0483f32063ca1017604c4be59219f", "ja": "え……？\nプロデューサーさん……。", "zh": "诶……？\n制作人先生……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0331_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0331_story_05_1023_014mir", "source_sha256": "4e298652280f329f9a5cca57d4395592d57ccde86b75eaf35e733cba415c6acb", "ja": "そ、そんな、お礼とかいいですよ～！\n絶対、私のおかげとかじゃないし！", "zh": "没、没必要道谢什么的啦～！\n绝对不是因为我的功劳！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0331_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0331_story_05_1024_401pro", "source_sha256": "aa0bdfce16dff0988c3f31bc56c21ad8a5dc3202bb46c312197c3734fe7f32c3", "ja": "原っぱライブもそうだった。\nみんなが未来から、大切なものを貰ったんだ。", "zh": "草地演唱会也是这样。  \n大家都从未来那里得到了珍贵的东西。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0331_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0331_story_05_1025_401pro", "source_sha256": "cf1bfb297ab0a37f0f6209b92b4cb045992cf53bec95c4632b0ab869392151e0", "ja": "自分を信じる勇気。周りを信じる勇気。\n……明日は晴れるって、信じる勇気を。", "zh": "相信自己的勇气。相信身边人的勇气。\n……还有相信明天会是晴天的勇气。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0331_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0331_story_05_1026_014mir", "source_sha256": "8021844d3ab655df702dde6665124d1037a86ee1bc9887c915006dcc0cd0a035", "ja": "わ、私はただ考えてないだけで……。\nいつもプロデューサーさんが何とかしてくれて……。", "zh": "我、我只是没想那么多而已啦……\n而且每次都是制作人先生替我想办法解决的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0331_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0331_story_05_1027_014mir", "source_sha256": "fc592c786bc561b2a0cb69252a5ab189ee6290af01f802bf536240c45549a608", "ja": "あ。そうです！\nプロデューサーさんこそです！", "zh": "啊，对了！制作人才是！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0331_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0331_story_05_1028_014mir", "source_sha256": "62efd8b9596d60f293208a20c86db01434f5d61284c7443764a4759e7dcb2020", "ja": "私がここにいるのも、劇場のみんながいるのも、\nプロデューサーさんのおかげです。絶対そうなんです！", "zh": "我能在这里，剧场里的大家也能在这里，\n都是托制作人先生的福。一定是这样的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0331_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0331_story_05_1029_014mir", "source_sha256": "7dc3d97fd1b372bd39f2dc5c8f5ae0f59ef962822482120ef7428cda3a59c101", "ja": "だから、お礼は誰より、\nプロデューサーさんが言われてください。", "zh": "所以，这句感谢，请制作人先生比谁都更理所应当地收下。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0331_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0331_story_05_1030_014mir", "source_sha256": "82d28730ef2ce125c16c5a84c7e930dd8af749afb90de4e5e67603f07571030d", "ja": "私だけじゃなくて、みんなの分も！\nすっごく、すーっごく！　ありがとうございます！！", "zh": "不只是我，还有大家的那份！\n非常非常地！　谢谢您！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0331_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0331_story_05_1031_401pro", "source_sha256": "9cbba6fba4e9def23592363a546b4bb9c236ef06f8c9ace444729b9e7ff4a4c9", "ja": "……うん、じゃあ、お互いに感謝ってことで！\n未来、これからも一緒に、走っていこう！", "zh": "……嗯，那就当成是互相感谢吧！\n未来，今后也一起并肩奔跑下去吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0331_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0331_story_05_1032_014mir", "source_sha256": "6b2db5126857ab1fdcc7ea6222ddffd354d36125f94cbd8f5a665863c2ed5fbd", "ja": "はいっ！　これからも、どこまでも！\nみ～んなで、一緒に！", "zh": "好！今后也要一起，跑向更远的地方！\n和大家一起！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0331_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0331_story_05_1033_null", "source_sha256": "70a7085a70355e7460350d4af910a652789d47f3119c0947921938299bd4e046", "ja": "そして、第1回定期公演初日……", "zh": "然后，第1次定期公演的首日……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0331_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0331_story_05_1034_audience", "source_sha256": "9772fa18e53059b344d4adb28217779356dc22194522871e9ebda61f4a24208f", "ja": "ワアアアアアアアッ！！", "zh": "哇啊啊啊啊啊啊啊！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0331_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0331_story_05_1035_014mir", "source_sha256": "d4547856a0d5c4548b7a79f14cf8617708a62db823b1b9a0588901195fd8e78c", "ja": "みなさん！\n本日は、ご来場ありがとうございます！", "zh": "各位！\n非常感谢大家今天的大驾光临！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0331_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0331_story_05_1036_014mir", "source_sha256": "294eecc693aac2df7f534691588a3d5c9d633f32a4f15ffdb430daf87e002394", "ja": "私達MILLIONSTARSは、\nTeam1stから始まって。", "zh": "我们MILLIONSTARS是从Team第1组开始的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0331_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0331_story_05_1037_014mir", "source_sha256": "7fd49063b5468dc72187d3823773ec2d51060cfdac719a06829aaf7b1bc6cc67", "ja": "2nd、3rd、4th、5th、6th、7thって、\nバトンをどんどん繋いでくれて。", "zh": "2nd、3rd、4th、5th、6th、7th，\n接力棒就这样一棒接着一棒传了下去。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0331_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0331_story_05_1038_014mir", "source_sha256": "eb4bc9b593dc00e7fa573e02e1330246ca90dbe8bbac66db4d48b77518c5f513", "ja": "最後に私たち、Team8thがバトンを受け取って。\nこけら落とし公演で、全員デビューしました！", "zh": "最后由我们Team8th接过了接力棒。\n在首演公演上，全员正式出道了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0331_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0331_story_05_1039_audience", "source_sha256": "9772fa18e53059b344d4adb28217779356dc22194522871e9ebda61f4a24208f", "ja": "ワアアアアアアアッ！！", "zh": "哇啊啊啊啊啊啊啊！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0331_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0331_story_05_1040_014mir", "source_sha256": "9009c97b821cdcd5129f184beacaa8b59c117935a4377c3e95f08d7e9513f2b4", "ja": "でも私達が受け取ったバトンは、まだここにあります。\n誰にも渡せてないんです！", "zh": "但是，我们接到的接力棒还在这里。\n还没能传给任何人！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0331_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0331_story_05_1041_014mir", "source_sha256": "72eba9ad306b009ceba7173c1be69e777a9d5ce75dea8ed333949f7ee40d5bd4", "ja": "だから、今度は私達から！　この第1回定期公演の\nステージから、みんなに渡したいと思います。", "zh": "所以，这次就由我们来！从第1回定期公演的舞台上，把它传递给大家！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0331_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0331_story_05_1042_014mir", "source_sha256": "5c1790ed99b3430f13888fcfddf8558b734cc58a83d5d38c391670e3e2d89043", "ja": "私達はアンカーで、ゴールテープを切ったけど！\nこのまま走り抜けて！　届けに行きたいと思います！", "zh": "我们虽然作为接力赛最后一棒冲过了终点线！但还要就这样一口气跑下去！把它传达给大家！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0331_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0331_story_05_1043_audience", "source_sha256": "9772fa18e53059b344d4adb28217779356dc22194522871e9ebda61f4a24208f", "ja": "ワアアアアアアアッ！！", "zh": "哇啊啊啊啊啊啊啊！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0331_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0331_story_05_1044_014mir", "source_sha256": "fde7d9195b279d96270a7398a29c7bc790104d496eaf370b8235e1a4ec928f35", "ja": "それじゃ、私達からの、初めてのバトンです！\nどうか……、受け取ってくださいっ！", "zh": "那么，这是我们第一次交给您的接力棒！\n请您……一定要接住！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
